WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.546 --> 00:00:06.297
Hey, sis. Phone call.

00:00:06.381 --> 00:00:07.298
Who is it?

00:00:07.382 --> 00:00:10.552
It's a guy. I won't tell the old man.

00:00:12.012 --> 00:00:13.638
He's so annoying.

00:00:19.561 --> 00:00:20.645
Hello?

00:00:21.521 --> 00:00:22.897
Huh? Shiraishi?

00:00:22.981 --> 00:00:25.150
It's Terumi. She's here.

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:27.277
She's moving slowly north.

00:00:27.819 --> 00:00:30.030
You can see her if you come now.

00:00:30.113 --> 00:00:33.074
I'm calling from the phone booth
at Eishoji Temple.

00:00:34.117 --> 00:00:35.535
Can you come right now?

00:00:46.755 --> 00:00:47.881
Shiraishi?

